+## G5 streamed metadata authentication proposal
+
+The additive hash_bounded_checked helper retains the existing4MiB expected+one
+stream bound and exact length/SHA256 result. Its injected check runs before
+allocation, before/after every read, after each hash update and after finalization.
+The original hash_bounded wrapper uses a no-op check and preserves existing CPU
+metadata behavior. G5 supplies its original expiry; no helper creates a new clock.
+The caller retains protected handle/parent custody and verifies identity/length.
